Unit–II: Plumbing & Sanitary Installation Practices 


08
Water supply systems (UGT, OHT, pumps); Pipe materials: GI, CPVC, UPVC, HDPE; 
Installation sequence in residential & institutional buildings; Sanitary fixtures, 
traps, vent pipes; Internal drainage systems; Testing: leakage, pressure & flow; 
Common defects and rectification methods.

unit3_text:
