Growth Strategies: Competitive market strategies for emerging industries, strategies for mature and 
declining brands and fragmented industries; projecting the Competitor’s Future Marketplace strategies; 
Marketing warfare strategies: Market leader strategies, market challenger strategies, market niches strategies

